<a href=\"/dashboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"btn--quinary\">Sign in</a><a class=\"btn btn--ghost btn--sm hidden lg:inline-flex\" href=\"/contact-sales?source=navbar\"><span class=\"xl:hidden\">Contact</span><span class=\"hidden xl:inline\">Contact sales</span></a><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--sm max-sm:hidden\" href=\"/download\">Download</a></div></div></header><!--&--><!--&--><main class=\"section section--longform\" id=\"main\"><section class=\"container\"><div class=\"grid-cursor gap-y-0\"><div class=\"col-span-full md:col-start-1 md:col-end-19 lg:col-start-1 lg:col-end-17 xl:col-start-7 xl:col-end-19\"><p class=\"text-theme-text-sec type-base pb-v3/12\">Changelog</p></div></div><article><div class=\"grid-cursor gap-y-0 pb-v5 mb-v5 border-theme-border-02 border-b\"><div class=\"mb-v2/12 col-span-full xl:col-end-7\"><p class=\"text-theme-text-sec sticky top-[var(--site-sticky-top)] left-[-1px] inline-flex items-center\"><a class=\"hover:text-theme-text inline-flex items-center\" href=\"/changelog/03-25-26\"><time dateTime=\"2026-03-25T00:00:00.000Z\" class=\"type-base\">Mar 25, 2026</time></a></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full md:col-start-1 md:col-end-19 lg:col-start-1 lg:col-end-17 xl:col-start-7 xl:col-end-19\"><header class=\"mb-v2 relative\"><h1 class=\"type-lg text-balance\" id=\"self-hosted-cloud-agents\"><a class=\"active:text-theme-text hover:opacity-90\" href=\"/changelog/03-25-26\">Self-hosted Cloud Agents</a></h1></header><div class=\"prose prose--block\"><p>Cursor now supports <a href=\"https://cursor.com/docs/cloud-agent/self-hosted\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">self-hosted cloud agents</a> that keep your code and tool execution entirely in your own network.</p>\n<p>Try it out today by enabling self-hosted cloud agents in your <a href=\"https://cursor.com/dashboard/cloud-agents#self-hosted-agents\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor Dashboard</a>. Read more in our <a href=\"https://cursor.com/blog/self-hosted-cloud-agents\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">announcement</a>.</p></div></div></div></article><article><div class=\"grid-cursor gap-y-0 pb-v5 mb-v5 border-theme-border-02 border-b\"><div class=\"mb-v2/12 col-span-full xl:col-end-7\"><p class=\"text-theme-text-sec sticky top-[var(--site-sticky-top)] left-[-1px] inline-flex items-center\"><a class=\"hover:text-theme-text inline-flex items-center\" href=\"/changelog/composer-2\"><time dateTime=\"2026-03-19T00:00:00.000Z\" class=\"type-base\">Mar 19, 2026</time></a></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full md:col-start-1 md:col-end-19 lg:col-start-1 lg:col-end-17 xl:col-start-7 xl:col-end-19\"><header class=\"mb-v2 relative\"><h1 class=\"type-lg text-balance\" id=\"composer-2\"><a class=\"active:text-theme-text hover:opacity-90\" href=\"/changelog/composer-2\">Composer 2</a></h1></header><div class=\"prose prose--block\"><p><a href=\"/blog/composer-2\">Composer 2</a> is now available in Cursor: frontier-level coding performance with <a href=\"/blog/cursorbench\">strong results</a> on challenging coding tasks.</p>\n<p>Read more in our <a href=\"/blog/composer-2\">announcement</a>.</p></div></div></div></article><article><div class=\"grid-cursor gap-y-0 pb-v5 mb-v5 border-theme-border-02 border-b\"><div class=\"mb-v2/12 col-span-full xl:col-end-7\"><p class=\"text-theme-text-sec sticky top-[var(--site-sticky-top)] left-[-1px] inline-flex items-center\"><a class=\"hover:text-theme-text inline-flex items-center\" href=\"/changelog/03-11-26\"><time dateTime=\"2026-03-11T00:00:00.000Z\" class=\"type-base\">Mar 11, 2026</time></a></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full md:col-start-1 md:col-end-19 lg:col-start-1 lg:col-end-17 xl:col-start-7 xl:col-end-19\"><header class=\"mb-v2 relative\"><h1 class=\"type-lg text-balance\" id=\"new-plugins-on-the-cursor-marketplace\"><a class=\"active:text-theme-text hover:opacity-90\" href=\"/changelog/03-11-26\">New Plugins on the Cursor Marketplace</a></h1></header><div class=\"prose prose--block\"><p>We&#x27;ve added more than 30 new <a href=\"https://cursor.com/docs/plugins\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">plugins</a> from partners such as Atlassian, Datadog, GitLab, Glean, Hugging Face, monday.com, and PlanetScale. Cursor can now read from, write to, and take actions across more of your stack.</p>\n<p>Try out the new plugins at <a href=\"https://cursor.com/marketplace\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cursor.com/marketplace</a>, or read more in our <a href=\"https://cursor.com/blog/new-plugins\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">announcement</a>.</p></div></div></div></article><article><div class=\"grid-cursor gap-y-0 pb-v5 mb-v5 border-theme-border-02 border-b\"><div class=\"mb-v2/12 col-span-full xl:col-end-7\"><p class=\"text-theme-text-sec sticky top-[var(--site-sticky-top)] left-[-1px] inline-flex items-center\"><a class=\"hover:text-theme-text inline-flex items-center\" href=\"/changelog/03-05-26\"><time dateTime=\"2026-03-05T00:00:00.000Z\" class=\"type-base\">Mar 5, 2026</time></a></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full md:col-start-1 md:col-end-19 lg:col-start-1 lg:col-end-17 xl:col-start-7 xl:col-end-19\"><header class=\"mb-v2 relative\"><h1 class=\"type-lg text-balance\" id=\"automations\"><a class=\"active:text-theme-text hover:opacity-90\" href=\"/changelog/03-05-26\">Automations</a></h1></header><div class=\"prose prose--block\"><p>Cursor now supports <a href=\"https://cursor.com/docs/cloud-agent/automations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">automations</a> for building always-on agents that run based on triggers and instructions you define.</p>\n<p>Create automations at <a href=\"https://cursor.com/automations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cursor.com/automations</a>, or start from a <a href=\"https://cursor.com/marketplace#automations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">template</a>. Read more in our <a href=\"https://cursor.com/blog/automations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">announcement</a>.</p></div></div></div></article><article><div class=\"grid-cursor gap-y-0  mb-v5 \"><div class=\"mb-v2/12 col-span-full xl:col-end-7\"><p class=\"text-theme-text-sec sticky top-[var(--site-sticky-top)] left-[-1px] inline-flex items-center\"><a class=\"hover:text-theme-text inline-flex items-center\" href=\"/changelog/03-04-26\"><time dateTime=\"2026-03-04T00:00:00.000Z\" class=\"type-base\">Mar 4, 2026</time></a></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full md:col-start-1 md:col-end-19 lg:col-start-1 lg:col-end-17 xl:col-start-7 xl:col-end-19\"><header class=\"mb-v2 relative\"><h1 class=\"type-lg text-balance\" id=\"cursor-in-jetbrains-ides\"><a class=\"active:text-theme-text hover:opacity-90\" href=\"/changelog/03-04-26\">Cursor in JetBrains IDEs</a></h1></header><div class=\"prose prose--block\"><p>Cursor is now available in IntelliJ IDEA, PyCharm, WebStorm, and other JetBrains IDEs through the Agent Client Protocol (ACP).</p>\n<p>Read more in our <a href=\"/blog/jetbrains-acp\">announcement</a>.</p></div></div></div></article><div class=\"grid-cursor\"><div class=\"col-span-full md:col-start-1 md:col-end-19 lg:col-start-1 lg:col-end-17 xl:col-start-7 xl:col-end-19\"><nav class=\"gap-x-g1 sm:flex justify-end\"><a class=\"btn-block card--pagination type-base text-right basis-full\" href=\"/changelog/page/2\"><span class=\"text-theme-text-sec\">Next →</span><span class=\"text-theme-text\">Older posts</span></a></nav></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><!--/&--><!--/&--><footer id=\"site-footer\" class=\"pt-v3 pb-v3 md:pb-g3 px-g2 bg-theme-card-hex relative\"><div class=\"mb-v4.5 container\"><nav><div class=\"gap-x-g1 gap-y-v2 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5\"><div><h3 class=\"type-base md:type-sm text-theme-text-sec pb-v2.5/12\">Product</h3><ul class=\"space-y-0\"><li><a class=\"type-base md:type-sm py-v2.5/12 footer-link inline-block hover:text-theme-text group\" hre