wordCount\":0}</script><section class=\"container\"><article class=\"grid-cursor border-theme-border-02 gap-y-0\"><div class=\"col-span-full max-xl:hidden xl:col-start-1 xl:col-end-7 xl:row-start-1 xl:row-end-3\"><div class=\"top-[var(--site-sticky-top)] lg:sticky\"><div class=\"type-base mb-v2/12 relative z-1\"><a class=\"text-theme-text-sec hover:text-theme-text active:text-theme-text-sec\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a> <span class=\"text-theme-text-sec\">/</span> <a class=\"text-theme-text-sec hover:text-theme-text active:text-theme-text-sec capitalize\" href=\"/blog/topic/research\">research</a></div></div></div><div class=\"col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid md:col-start-1 md:col-end-19 lg:col-start-1 lg:col-end-17 xl:col-start-7 xl:col-end-19\"><div class=\"col-span-full\"><header class=\"mb-v2\"><div class=\"type-base text-theme-text-mid mb-v2/12 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-v3/12 gap-y-v1/12\"><time dateTime=\"2026-03-19T00:00:00.000Z\">Mar 19, 2026</time><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"xl:hidden\">·</span><a class=\"hover:text-theme-text active:text-theme-text-mid capitalize xl:hidden\" href=\"/blog/topic/research\">research</a></div><h1 class=\"type-lg text-balance\">Introducing Composer 2</h1><div class=\"mt-v5/12 type-base text-theme-text-mid\"><span class=\"text-theme-text-mid\">3 min read</span></div></header></div></div><div class=\"col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid md:col-start-1 md:col-end-19 lg:col-start-1 lg:col-end-17 xl:col-start-7 xl:col-end-19\"><div class=\"col-span-full\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"prose prose--block prose--blog col-span-full!\"><p>Composer 2 is now available in Cursor.</p>\n<p>It&#x27;s frontier-level at coding and priced at $0.50/M input and $2.50/M output tokens, making it a new, optimal combination of intelligence and cost. We also released a <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.24477\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">technical report</a> on how we trained it.</p>\n<figure><div class=\"media-border-container overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Composer 2 efficiency and quality on CursorBench\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"media-light transition-opacity duration-[220ms] ease-[var(--ease-out-spring)] will-change-[opacity] opacity-0\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-2-scatter-r4.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=70 1x, /marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-2-scatter-r4.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=70 2x\" src=\"/marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-2-scatter-r4.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=70\"/><img alt=\"Composer 2 efficiency and quality on CursorBench\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"media-dark transition-opacity duration-[220ms] ease-[var(--ease-out-spring)] will-change-[opacity] opacity-0\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-2-scatter-r4-dark.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=70 1x, /marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-2-scatter-r4-dark.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=70 2x\" src=\"/marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-2-scatter-r4-dark.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=70\"/></div></figure>\n<h2 id=\"frontier-level-coding-intelligence\" class=\"anchor-heading group \"><a href=\"#frontier-level-coding-intelligence\" class=\"anchor-link\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\"><span class=\"anchor-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</span></a>Frontier-level coding intelligence</h2>\n<p>We&#x27;re rapidly improving the quality of our model. Composer 2 delivers large improvements on all <a href=\"/blog/cursorbench\">benchmarks we measure</a>, including Terminal-Bench 2.0<sup id=\"fnref-1\"><a href=\"#fn-1\">1</a></sup> and SWE-bench Multilingual:</p>\n<figure><div class=\"media-border-container overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Composer 2 Terminal-Bench 2.0 results\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"media-light transition-opacity duration-[220ms] ease-[var(--ease-out-spring)] will-change-[opacity] opacity-0\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-2-terminal-bench-score-r9.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=70 1x, /marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-2-terminal-bench-score-r9.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=70 2x\" src=\"/marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-2-terminal-bench-score-r9.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=70\"/><img alt=\"Composer 2 Terminal-Bench 2.0 results\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"media-dark transition-opacity duration-[220ms] ease-[var(--ease-out-spring)] will-change-[opacity] opacity-0\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-2-terminal-bench-score-r9-dark.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=70 1x, /marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-2-terminal-bench-score-r9-dark.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=70 2x\" src=\"/marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-2-terminal-bench-score-r9-dark.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=70\"/></div></figure>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"w-full\"><thead><tr><th class=\"pb-v5/12 pr-g1 border-theme-border-02 border-b text-left text-sm font-bold whitespace-pre [&amp;:last-of-type]:pr-0\">Model</th><th class=\"pb-v5/12 pr-g1 border-theme-border-02 border-b text-left text-sm font-bold whitespace-pre [&amp;:last-of-type]:pr-0\">CursorBench</th><th class=\"pb-v5/12 pr-g1 border-theme-border-02 border-b text-left text-sm font-bold whitespace-pre [&amp;:last-of-type]:pr-0\">Terminal-Bench 2.0</th><th class=\"pb-v5/12 pr-g1 border-theme-border-02 border-b text-left text-sm font-bold whitespace-pre [&amp;:last-of-type]:pr-0\">SWE-bench Multilingual</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-theme-border-02 border-b last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"pt-v5/12 pr-g1 md:pt-v7/12 text-left align-top text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;:last-of-type]:pr-0  \">Composer 2</td><td class=\"pt-v5/12 pr-g1 md:pt-v7/12 text-left align-top text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;:last-of-type]:pr-0  \">61.3</td><td class=\"pt-v5/12 pr-g1 md:pt-v7/12 text-left align-top text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;:last-of-type]:pr-0  \">61.7</td><td class=\"pt-v5/12 pr-g1 md:pt-v7/12 text-left align-top text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;:last-of-type]:pr-0  \">73.7</td></tr><tr class=\"border-theme-border-02 border-b last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"pt-v5/12 pr-g1 md:pt-v7/12 text-left align-top text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;:last-of-type]:pr-0  \">Composer 1.5</td><td class=\"pt-v5/12 pr-g1 md:pt-v7/12 text-left align-top text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;:last-of-type]:pr-0  \">44.2</td><td class=\"pt-v5/12 pr-g1 md:pt-v7/12 text-left align-top text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;:last-of-type]:pr-0  \">47.9</td><td class=\"pt-v5/12 pr-g1 md:pt-v7/12 text-left align-top text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;:last-of-type]:pr-0  \">65.9</td></tr><tr class=\"border-theme-border-02 border-b last:border-b-0\"><td class=\"pt-v5/12 pr-g1 md:pt-v7/12 text-left align-top text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;:last-of-type]:pr-0  \">Composer 1</td><td class=\"pt-v5/12 pr-g1 md:pt-v7/12 text-left align-top text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;:last-of-type]:pr-0  \">38.0</td><td class=\"pt-v5/12 pr-g1 md:pt-v7/12 text-left align-top text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;:last-of-type]:pr-0  \">40.0</td><td class=\"pt-v5/12 pr-g1 md:pt-v7/12 text-left align-top text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;:last-of-type]:pr-0  \">56.9</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>These quality improvements come from our first continued pretraining run, which provides a far stronger base to scale our reinforcement learning.</p>\n<p>From this base, we train on <a href=\"/blog/self-driving-codebases\">long-horizon</a> coding tasks through <a href=\"/blog/self-summarization\">reinforcement learning</a>. Composer 2 is able to solve challenging tasks requiring hundreds of actions.</p>\n<h2 id=\"try-composer-2\" class=\"anchor-heading group \"><a href=\"#try-composer-2\" class=\"anchor-link\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\"><span class=\"anchor-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</span></a>Try Composer 2</h2>\n<p>Composer 2 is priced at $0.50/M input and $2.50/M output tokens.</p>\n<p>There is also a <strong>faster variant with the same intelligence</strong> at $1.50/M input and $7.50/M output tokens, which has a lower cost than other fast models<sup id=\"fnref-2\"><a href=\"#fn-2\">2</a></sup>. We&#x27;re making fast the default option. See our <a href=\"/docs/models/cursor-composer-2\">model docs</a> for full details.</p>\n<figure><div class=\"media-border-container overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Composer 2 fast variant speed and cost compared to other models\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"media-light transition-opacity duration-[220ms] ease-[var(--ease-out-spring)] will-change-[opacity] opacity-0\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-speed-cost-r12.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=70 1x, /marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-speed-cost-r12.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=70 2x\" src=\"/marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-speed-cost-r12.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=70\"/><img alt=\"Composer 2 fast variant speed and cost compared to other models\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"media-dark transition-opacity duration-[220ms] ease-[var(--ease-out-spring)] will-change-[opacity] opacity-0\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-speed-cost-r12-dark.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=70 1x, /marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-speed-cost-r12-dark.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=70 2x\" src=\"/marketing-static/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fptht05hbb1ssoooe.public.blob.vercel-storage.com%2Fassets%2Fblog%2Fcomposer-speed-cost-r12-dark.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=70\"/></div></figure>\n<p>On individual plan\n\n... [17 lines truncated] ...",
