y: 692 },{ x: 'v0.59.0', y: 56 },{ x: 'v0.60.0', y: 132 },{ x: 'v0.61.0', y: 427 },{ x: 'v0.62.0', y: 16 },{ x: 'v0.63.0', y: 302 },{ x: 'v0.64.0', y: 323 },{ x: 'v0.65.0', y: 136 },{ x: 'v0.66.0', y: 135 },{ x: 'v0.67.0', y: 237 },{ x: 'v0.68.0', y: 224 },{ x: 'v0.69.0', y: 100 },{ x: 'v0.70.0', y: 319 },{ x: 'v0.71.0', y: 154 },{ x: 'v0.72.0', y: 172 },{ x: 'v0.73.0', y: 604 },{ x: 'v0.74.0', y: 237 },{ x: 'v0.75.0', y: 213 },{ x: 'v0.76.0', y: 353 },{ x: 'v0.77.0', y: 652 },{ x: 'v0.78.0', y: 239 },{ x: 'v0.79.0', y: 117 },{ x: 'v0.80.0', y: 278 },{ x: 'v0.81.0', y: 38 },{ x: 'v0.82.0', y: 139 },{ x: 'v0.83.0', y: 859 },{ x: 'v0.84.0', y: 175 },{ x: 'v0.85.0', y: 471 },{ x: 'v0.86.0', y: 31 },],\n            backgroundColor: 'rgba(200, 200, 200, 0.8)',\n            borderColor: 'rgba(200, 200, 200, 1)',\n<h2 id=\"release-notes\">\n<h3 id=\"main-branch\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0861\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0860\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0855\">\n<ul>\n  <li>Fixed model detection to correctly apply GPT-5 settings to versioned names (gpt-5 and gpt-5-2025-08-07).</li>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0854\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0853\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0852\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0851\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0850\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0840\">\n<ul>\n  <li>Added support for new Claude models including the Sonnet 4 and Opus 4 series (e.g., <code class=\"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge\">claude-sonnet-4-20250514</code>,\n<code class=\"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge\">claude-opus-4-20250514</code>) across various providers. The default <code class=\"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge\">sonnet</code> and <code class=\"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge\">opus</code> aliases were updated to these newer\n  <li>Added support for the <code class=\"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge\">vertex_ai/gemini-2.5-flash-preview-05-20</code> model.</li>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0832\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0831\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0830\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0823\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0822\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0821\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0820\">\n    <a href=\"#aider-v0820\" class=\"anchor-heading\" aria-labelledby=\"aider-v0820\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#svg-link\"></use></svg></a> Aider v0.82.0\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0813\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0812\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0811\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0810\">\n<ul>\n    <ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0804\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0803\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0802\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0801\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0800\">\n<ul>\n    <ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0792\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0791\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0790\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0780\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0771\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0770\">\n<ul>\n    <ul>\n      <li>20 new languages with repo-map support.</li>\n  <li>Added support for <code class=\"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge\">cohere_chat/command-a-03-2025</code> and <code class=\"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge\">gemini/gemma-3-27b-it</code></li>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0762\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0761\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0760\">\n<ul>\n    <ul>\n    <ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0753\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0752\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0751\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0750\">\n<ul>\n    <ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0743\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0742\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0741\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0740\">\n<ul>\n    <ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0730\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0723\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0722\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0721\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0720\">\n    <a href=\"#aider-v0720\" class=\"anchor-heading\" aria-labelledby=\"aider-v0720\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#svg-link\"></use></svg></a> Aider v0.72.0\n<ul>\n    <ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0711\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0710\">\n<ul>\n    <ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0700\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0691\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0690\">\n<ul>\n    <ul>\n    <ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0680\">\n<ul>\n    <ul>\n    <ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0670\">\n<ul>\n    <ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0660\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0651\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0650\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0641\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0640\">\n<ul>\n  <li>Full support for <code class=\"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge\">gpt-4o-2024-11-20</code>.</li>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0632\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0631\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0630\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0620\">\n    <a href=\"#aider-v0620\" class=\"anchor-heading\" aria-labelledby=\"aider-v0620\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#svg-link\"></use></svg></a> Aider v0.62.0\n<ul>\n    <ul>\n    <ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0610\">\n<ul>\n    <ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0601\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0600\">\n<ul>\n    <ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0591\">\n<ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0590\">\n<ul>",
