        "tool_use_id": "call_fc92489056de415984769446",
        "type": "tool_result",
        "content": "  <li>Aider wrote 62% of the code in this release.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0861\">\n  \n  \n    <a href=\"#aider-v0861\" class=\"anchor-heading\" aria-labelledby=\"aider-v0861\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#svg-link\"></use></svg></a> Aider v0.86.1\n  \n  \n</h3>\n    \n\n<ul>\n  <li>Added a reasoning_effort setting for GPT-5 models and disabled temperature by default for the GPT-5 family.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0860\">\n  \n  \n    <a href=\"#aider-v0860\" class=\"anchor-heading\" aria-labelledby=\"aider-v0860\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#svg-link\"></use></svg></a> Aider v0.86.0\n  \n  \n</h3>\n    \n\n<ul>\n  <li>Expanded GPT-5 model support across family variants and providers (OpenAI, Azure, OpenRouter), including dated and chat/mini/nano variants.</li>\n  <li>Aider wrote 88% of the code in this release.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0855\">\n  \n  \n    <a href=\"#aider-v0855\" class=\"anchor-heading\" aria-labelledby=\"aider-v0855\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#svg-link\"></use></svg></a> Aider v0.85.5\n  \n  \n</h3>\n    \n\n<ul>\n  <li>Enforced diff edit format for GPT-5 models.</li>\n  <li>Added support for the reasoning_effort setting for GPT-5 models.</li>\n  <li>Fixed model detection to correctly apply GPT-5 settings to versioned names (gpt-5 and gpt-5-2025-08-07).</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0854\">\n  \n  \n    <a href=\"#aider-v0854\" class=\"anchor-heading\" aria-labelledby=\"aider-v0854\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#svg-link\"></use></svg></a> Aider v0.85.4\n  \n  \n</h3>\n    \n\n<ul>\n  <li>Added support for openai/gpt-5</li>\n  <li>Fixed analytics to support the latest PostHog SDK event-capture API.</li>\n  <li>Disabled temperature when using GPT-5 models for more deterministic outputs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"aider-v0853\">",
        "is_error": false
      }
    ]
  },
