id=\"whats-new\" ><a class=\"heading-link\" href=\"#whats-new\">What&rsquo;s new<span class=\"heading-hash pl-2 text-italic text-bold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a></h2>\n<p>We now instruct Copilot coding agent to include your Jira ticket number in the pull request title and branch name. The pull request will also include a link back to the originating Jira ticket and the Jira context provided to the agent. This makes it easier to trace work from Jira through to your codebase.</p>\n<h2 id=\"getting-started\" id=\"getting-started\" ><a class=\"heading-link\" href=\"#getting-started\">Getting started<span class=\"heading-hash pl-2 text-italic text-bold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a></h2>",
